de47dcb-626e-44b6-ae58-50594e7387c1</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:2de47dcb-626e-44b6-ae58-50594e7387c1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:2de47dcb-626e-44b6-ae58-50594e7387c1\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Imwise\" title=\"Imwise\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Portrait_Imwise.png/25px-Portrait_Imwise.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Portrait_Imwise.png/38px-Portrait_Imwise.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Portrait_Imwise.png/50px-Portrait_Imwise.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sharran Sentry Imwise\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Portrait_Imwise.png/25px-Portrait_Imwise.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d4/Portrait_Imwise.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Imwise\" title=\"Imwise\">Sharran Sentry Imwise</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Cloister_of_Sombre_Embrace\" title=\"Cloister of Sombre Embrace\">Cloister of Sombre Embrace</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Twosday's inspection was a disaster. How could I have overlooked the stains on my tunic? Must ask <a href=\"/wiki/Hyrald\" title=\"Hyrald\">Hyrald</a> where they get that special soap that takes dried blood out of fabric.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715012610\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1857/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30361/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7248/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930825/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   40.643      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   40.643      1 -total\n 56.93%   23.137      8 Template:Icon_text\n 50.10%   20.364     19 Template:Trim\n 21.96%    8.925      2 Template:Uid\n 15.36%    6.241      3 Template:Icon_link\n 15.17%    6.165      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.82%    5.210      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.44%    4.242      1 Template:Ifexist\n 10.38%    4.217      2 Template:CharLink\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:42822-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715012610 and revision id 365601. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}